WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.386
The Cannabis escrow contract implementation records the budget, worker shares, deadlines,

00:00:05.386 --> 00:00:10.771
review period, and dispute resolver before work begins. Every worker must

00:00:10.771 --> 00:00:12.240
accept the terms.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.677
A requester reviews the encrypted delivery and can approve it or

00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:22.813
open a dispute. The contract also defines cancellation, refunds, and timeout

00:00:22.813 --> 00:00:23.280
outcomes.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:28.878
Pay attention to the review window: an undisputed delivery becomes payable

00:00:28.878 --> 00:00:33.596
when that window expires. The contract still needs independent review and

00:00:33.596 --> 00:00:38.313
deployment. Read the payment guide, understand the terms, and help build

00:00:38.313 --> 00:00:39.600
a dependable service.
